{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "sha256:54bf72b590608d13f146f31fbb55206af66760a4a58609c206939ee6c468e903", "hash": "sha256:54bf72b590608d13f146f31fbb55206af66760a4a58609c206939ee6c468e903", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 280224, "byte_start": 279458, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:92c6224c5d61a266c0a4d1c592d397c9db3b21325227ca9b935dfa8cab43b15a", "line_end": 7377, "line_start": 7360}, "owner_tag": "075T", "parent_tag": "075T", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-descent-remark-list-local-source-target}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-base-change-smooth}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-descent-lemma-descending-property-smooth}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-local-source-target}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ba9059a394654589e82780439601c449305f7770a1974afff14a7dc31e7a2ce3", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nThe property ``being smooth'' of morphisms of algebraic\nspaces is smooth local on the source-and-target, see\nDescent on Spaces, Remark <REF_0001>.\nIt is also stable under base change and fpqc local on the target, see\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0002>\nand\nDescent on Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0003>.\nHence, by\nLemma <REF_0004>\nabove, we may define what it means for a morphism of algebraic spaces\nto be smooth as follows and it agrees with the already\nexisting notion defined in\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0005>\nwhen the morphism is representable by algebraic spaces.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2cfdd8f26e536051af26b4767407b7a4afc0995a730a50ba82cbf35a8ac6f808", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:075T:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:37e9c9a36321747e57233a7000069e8df36d06cde5dee0cb7018d810b95bf259", "hash": "sha256:37e9c9a36321747e57233a7000069e8df36d06cde5dee0cb7018d810b95bf259", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 280605, "byte_start": 280500, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:76f2d2ae087e9ca14db8772f58c4d98803985d0c78e8f46e6161706e77157f4d", "line_end": 7390, "line_start": 7387}, "owner_tag": "075V", "parent_tag": "075T", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-composition-smooth}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:422908f2ff94278ec5d90ce1ea3442548bb6424c59f0128fbfb1225b473bd0ab", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nThe composition of smooth morphisms is smooth.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:36d290f82a030b9e3468946ece7690fa6537dd2657132538d847b3f0e401b59c", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:075V:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:24de6fd4aa179792367dfd0387f1894956af7b103d6c0f74b2d0f13e5860b7d3", "hash": "sha256:24de6fd4aa179792367dfd0387f1894956af7b103d6c0f74b2d0f13e5860b7d3", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 110543, "byte_start": 109279, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3d947fb3cd19e8423537311ed9adbf370b034046005b268644184dfe001f5a8d", "line_end": 3053, "line_start": 3023}, "owner_tag": "06FM", "parent_tag": "06FL", "requested_label": "stacks-morphisms-lemma-local-source-target", "requested_tag": "06FM", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06FL", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-local-source-target}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU \\ar[d]_a \\ar[r]_h & V \\ar[d]^b \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]^f & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$V$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} V$", "MATH_0007": "$h$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0009": "$a : U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$h$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0014": "$f$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0017": "$f$", "MATH_0018": "$f$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:21d3fd4d2f758f9fce4653914a822ca3045e36c98445eb734d0f4e0d67cd7612", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6c68f124a59818d764bd9bce57c862c39ec73f5f965a4906e46d9bf4052dbae6", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a property of morphisms of algebraic spaces\nwhich is smooth local on the source-and-target.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nConsider commutative diagrams\n<MATH_0003>\nwhere <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are algebraic spaces and the vertical arrows are smooth.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> for any diagram as above such that in addition\n<MATH_0006> is smooth\nthe morphism <MATH_0007> has property <MATH_0008>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for some diagram as above with <MATH_0009> surjective\nthe morphism <MATH_0010> has property <MATH_0011>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nIf <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> are representable by algebraic spaces,\nthen this is also equivalent to <MATH_0014> (as a morphism of algebraic spaces)\nhaving property <MATH_0015>. If <MATH_0016> is also preserved under\nany base change, and fppf local on the base, then for morphisms <MATH_0017>\nwhich are representable by algebraic spaces this\nis also equivalent to <MATH_0018> having property <MATH_0019> in the sense\nof\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:01acdc55192e610ca824e9f704e788e529f66baf029ccdcaa3aaf15bf3910c57", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FM:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:44f68c0b0e613d7df9f545a3183b3a51602d44fe38f1ed319e5625bc8511b500", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p049.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:70783904dfb15c202f5b32195aef6bee7e5b81f833a3d993a649d9ef3db39824", "path": "docs/evidence/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p049-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:7226237c0c463b4559d8997d1c1c5e1ecaf322a23a26bd46c8e95fa98b11db04"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:7c4e1984fe4e6b4ae37e01477744ca9f9a46294c", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p049", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a20c5d-0b51-7223-9f72-964ffb788f5a", "unit_id": "tag:075U:statement"}, "context_hash": "sha256:7bbd48e1130ad29509b41045862e7ed6bfd0f78328e0588858ab997729b15f8e", "created_at": "2026-11-24T07:02:37.390515+0